This ISO includes your custom configurations and dotfiles.

Quick start:
  1. Connect to Wi-Fi (if needed): iwctl
  2. Run the automated installer: ./install-hifam.sh

  Or use archinstall manually:
    archinstall --config /root/hifam-config/user_configuration.json

Documentation: /root/README.md  |  Configs: /root/hifam-config/

